{"version":1,"key":"card:416","content":{"id":416,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"考虑一个列表场景，包含多个垂直排列的子项，每个子项之间需要隔开一定的间隔，一般的写法是为每个子项设置外边距，如","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"456cdc84-9e9a-4c99-9f14-28339b2f960b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  \n}\n\n.item {\n  /* 上下保证 20px 的间距 */\n  margin: 20px 0;\n}","collabId":"acf5b6f0-3c48-4ade-918e-8a278df6c52c","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"9dd8a84c-a7d7-478b-9a3d-9f2dfe85f576","language":"CSS","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"9c19b318-7b79-405d-a98e-851bf5119954"},{"children":[{"text":"但是第一个和最后一个和容器是没有间隔的，为了做到这一点，需要对第一个和最后一个 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"item","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 进行特殊处理","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"11f6f885-1073-4a04-9bd2-a7f48484fbe4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  \n}\n\n.item {\n  margin: 20px 0;\n}\n.item:first-child, .item:last-child {\n  margin: 0;\n}","collabId":"aa7e5ee6-eb9d-4961-8aba-3f7dbafa9a07","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"9f21d0bc-a1e0-41d8-b345-0ab3faea5a2d","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"65e65709-71d6-4e9b-8925-f94acc8513cf"},{"children":[{"text":"这样写非常的麻烦，CSS 属性 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"margin-trim","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可以实现上述效果而不用这么麻烦，它的取值语法如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8a314968-a18c-4c2a-9f6e-4977f031c58c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"margin-trim = \n  none                                                |\n  block                                               |\n  inline                                              |\n  [ block-start || inline-start || block-end || inline-end ]","collabId":"e3e9d436-b4f5-4ca2-9203-984b9108ad90","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"350c050e-6947-4813-8a42-6f6d3373cd4a","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"47accbac-646a-455d-883d-6cb88f9ea611"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"block","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：块级子元素与容器的外边距会被裁剪为 0","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"550bd5af-9f81-4156-998b-d978f3785ebb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7dc05dda-5251-41cd-8194-c087f3fed017","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"inline","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：内联子元素与容器的外边距会被裁剪为 0","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"54ae63f9-ef91-408a-9eb1-dfc94f863be2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"00e1e3d4-ec00-4706-9549-55d4a9969c4f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"3233bdf2-b491-45a5-8d10-fa6cfd236f37","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"默认值为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"none","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5aa923a4-ad37-486e-85f7-42145af39fea","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"start","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"end","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 来具体指定某一个方向，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"block","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 相当于同时设置了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"block-start","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"block-end","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inline","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 相当于同时设置了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inline-start","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"inline-end","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d7261e28-da3d-46a7-a618-be57ce32afa7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"之所使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"start","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"end","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，而不是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"left/top","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"right/bottom","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，是考虑到有一些国家它们的阅读方向是从右向左，使用逻辑上的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"start","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"end","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 比较合理，对于我们来说，可以把 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"start","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 骄看作是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"left/top","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"end","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 看作是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"right/bottom","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"80e98c11-2332-4a96-8bf4-e0c4827b6710","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"6a54d353-fb0d-4706-941d-d6a52d117f6f","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"信息","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"对于上面的案例，可以修改如下写法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4caaacc1-1f66-4b9c-91c5-c83cb6fd26bd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  /* 块级子元素与父容器的外边距裁剪为 0 */\n  margin-trim: block;\n}\n\n.item {\n  margin: 20px 0;\n}","collabId":"d1130b5a-c26b-4fa2-a1d1-49af5a7d0102","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"d8b9d555-5ab3-477b-819f-3eb577d461cb","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"a99f560d-f621-4e92-baa6-3a9a50ed6ba4"},{"calloutType":"tip","children":[{"children":[{"text":"当然，对于上述场景有更简单的解法","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"bd8fc025-c964-4029-abd8-7bac1117fcbf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":".list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}","collabId":"5cec8671-4f9e-4439-8504-7b4bdc7219d6","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"78712038-85d4-4f80-86e5-6344f368b809","language":"css","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"1c273a13-a2fc-4f28-ae2d-f0216fdeda84"},{"children":[{"text":"但是提出了新的解决方案也是极好的，有可能在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"flex","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 布局存在限制的情况了使用此布局，甚至可以结合 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"flex","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 布局更轻松的实现目的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1bc03593-4012-40a9-9716-5a7091de707c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"cd7549dd-b00b-4ee0-92fd-058908a2ee5b","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"calloutType":"warning","children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"margin-trim","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 目前只有 Safari 支持，想要在生产环境使用上这个特性可能还需要等上几年。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b6c92aaf-002b-4634-b6d0-68727db65e7f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6e98dd4e-3910-49bd-bfba-4ee587f7dd08","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_894cb2b6-143e-49d4-a75d-459a14400c68.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_894cb2b6-143e-49d4-a75d-459a14400c68.png"}],"collabId":"e7f2c768-ce2e-45de-93e2-14f345b2ff61","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"","type":"callout"},{"children":[{"text":"参考：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e37662b8-4cd3-4452-bda7-0aa74cbf4fcc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"margin-trim","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2ad27cf0-69d6-4c13-8b1a-be070a19db60","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/margin-trim"}],"collabId":"3edc15b1-f6e2-40fe-bb7e-65468d002c74","disableDrag":